silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_03_sees_as_patient_concrete_anchors#drpatelapex silm:hasLongDescription "The DrPatelApex is Dr. Patel the household-registered veterinarian, presented as the colimit of her DEA number, her clinic, her chart roster, and her authored records. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Vet77_apex', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
