silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_03_sees_as_patient_concrete_anchors#cliniciantopatientrole silm:hasLongDescription "The ClinicianToPatientRole is the typed upper-level role arrow Vet77_apex -> colim D_cat; Dr. Patel sees the cat as a patient on her chart roster. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'sees_as_patient', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
