silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_02_cross_entity_reference_arrows_sections_03_sees_as_patient_concrete_anchors#catpatient silm:hasLongDescription "The CatPatient is the cat patient sub-apex (Mittens or Pumpkin); the target of the typed role arrow. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'cat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
